<!doctype html>
<html lang="ru">

<head>
  <%- include('../partials/head', {
    title: title || 'UNQX Lucky | Премиум слот',
    description: description || 'UNQX Lucky: 1 спин в день, только свободные AAA000 и авто-скидка 10% на выпавший slug.',
    image: typeof image === 'string' ? image : undefined,
    styles: ['/css/public-card.css', '/css/unqx-game.css'],
  }) %>
</head>

<body class="antialiased" data-page="unqx-game">
  <main class="unqx-lucky-page mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-8">
    <header class="unqx-lucky-topbar mb-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <a href="/"
        class="interactive-btn inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-xl border border-neutral-300/60 px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700 hover:text-neutral-900">
        <svg class="icon-stroke h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M15 18 9 12l6-6"></path>
        </svg>
        На главную
      </a>
      <p class="unqx-lucky-brand text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">UNQX LUCKY</p>
    </header>

    <section class="unqx-lucky-hero rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200/70 p-6 md:p-7">
      <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] md:items-end">
        <div>
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Premium Experience</p>
          <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-black leading-tight text-neutral-900 md:text-4xl">UNQX Lucky</h1>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
            Один спин в день. Все 6 барабанов крутятся, останавливаются по очереди и дают только свободный slug формата AAA000.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="unqx-lucky-pills flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:justify-end">
          <span class="unqx-lucky-pill">Только свободные slug</span>
          <span class="unqx-lucky-pill">Авто-скидка 10%</span>
          <span class="unqx-lucky-pill">История победителей</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-6 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[1.25fr_0.75fr]">
      <article class="unqx-lucky-card rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200/70 p-6">
        <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Slot Machine</p>
          <p id="unqx-game-status" class="unqx-game-status text-xs text-neutral-500" data-tone="neutral" aria-live="polite">Готово к запуску.</p>
        </div>

        <div id="unqx-game-reel" class="unqx-game-reel rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/70 p-4">
          <div id="unqx-game-slot-machine" class="unqx-game-slot-machine" aria-label="UNQX Lucky слот-машина">
            <div class="unqx-game-slot-row" role="presentation">
              <span class="unqx-game-slot" data-slot-index="0">A</span>
              <span class="unqx-game-slot" data-slot-index="1">A</span>
              <span class="unqx-game-slot" data-slot-index="2">A</span>
              <span class="unqx-game-slot is-divider" data-slot-index="3">0</span>
              <span class="unqx-game-slot" data-slot-index="4">0</span>
              <span class="unqx-game-slot" data-slot-index="5">0</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 space-y-1">
            <p id="unqx-game-result-slug" class="text-xl font-black tracking-[0.16em] text-neutral-900">---</p>
            <p id="unqx-game-result-price" class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-700">Цена: ---</p>
            <p id="unqx-game-result-time" class="text-xs text-neutral-500">Время: ---</p>
          </div>

          <div id="unqx-game-lucky-box" class="unqx-game-lucky-box mt-3 hidden rounded-xl border border-emerald-200/80 bg-emerald-50/80 px-3 py-2">
            <p id="unqx-game-lucky-text" class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-800">Lucky-бонус: ---</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
          <button type="button" id="unqx-game-spin-button"
            class="interactive-btn min-h-11 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-neutral-800">
            Крутить
          </button>
          <span id="unqx-game-spin-limit" class="text-xs text-neutral-500">1 попытка в день (Asia/Tashkent)</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <aside class="unqx-lucky-card unqx-lucky-side rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200/70 p-6">
        <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-neutral-500">Сегодня</p>
        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-black text-neutral-900">Один выстрел</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-700">
          Выпавший slug сразу получает lucky-скидку 10% до полуночи по времени Ташкента.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm text-neutral-700">
          <p>• Формат: строго AAA000</p>
          <p>• Выдача: только свободные комбинации</p>
          <p>• История: последние 10 выпадений</p>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="unqx-lucky-card mt-6 rounded-3xl border border-neutral-200/70 p-6">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900">История победителей</h2>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-500">Показываем только последние 10 выпадений. Лента автообновляется.</p>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="unqx-game-history-refresh"
          class="interactive-btn min-h-11 rounded-xl border border-neutral-300/70 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-700">
          Обновить
        </button>
      </div>

      <ul id="unqx-game-history-list" class="mt-4 space-y-2"></ul>
      <p id="unqx-game-history-empty" class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200/70 bg-white/60 px-4 py-3 text-sm text-neutral-500">
        Пока пусто. Сделайте первый спин.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div id="unqx-game-modal-overlay" class="unqx-game-modal-overlay hidden" aria-hidden="true">
    <div id="unqx-game-modal" class="unqx-game-modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="unqx-game-modal-title">
      <button id="unqx-game-modal-close" type="button" class="unqx-game-modal-close" aria-label="Закрыть">
        <span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
      </button>
      <p id="unqx-game-modal-badge" class="unqx-game-modal-badge">UNQX Lucky</p>
      <h3 id="unqx-game-modal-title" class="unqx-game-modal-title">Уведомление</h3>
      <p id="unqx-game-modal-message" class="unqx-game-modal-message">Сообщение</p>
      <div class="unqx-game-modal-actions">
        <button id="unqx-game-modal-action" type="button" class="interactive-btn unqx-game-modal-action">Понятно</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script nonce="<%= cspNonce %>" src="/js/unqx-game.js"></script>
</body>

</html>
